# Binaries
/roady
/roady-plugin-*
dist/
# ...but not the built MCP App UIs. They are generated, yet they are also
# //go:embed inputs, so the package does not compile without them. The bare
# `dist/` rule above silently swallowed new files here: the existing ones are
# tracked only because they predate it, which is why ui://roady/billing
# shipped registered-but-missing.
!internal/infrastructure/mcp/dist/
!internal/infrastructure/mcp/dist/**

# OS files
.DS_Store

# Roady's own workspace.
#
# Not ignored wholesale. Roady's claim is that .roady/ is durable state you
# commit, so ignoring all of it in the repository that dogfoods it is the
# `dist/` mistake above repeating: the five files in there are tracked only
# because they predate the rule, and anything Roady wrote later — policy.yaml,
# rates.yaml, a sub-project under projects/ — would have been swallowed
# silently, in the one repository where that would be noticed last.
#
# Ignore only what is genuinely local to one machine.
.roady/usage.json
.roady/deadletters.jsonl

# Stray deadletter artifact written when webhook tests run in cwd
deadletters.jsonl

# Coverage and Reports
.cover/
!.cover/history.json
.verdict/
coverage.out
findings.json

# Relicta artifacts
.relicta/

# Local guidance
AGENTS.md

# IDEs
.vscode/
.idea/

# MCP Apps
app/node_modules/
app/dist/
# internal/infrastructure/mcp/dist/ is committed for go:embed

# Website
website/node_modules/
website/dist/
website/.astro/

# Playwright MCP screenshots
.playwright-mcp/

# Claude local settings
.claude/settings.local.json
memory/
